# Alpha, Blade of Enmity

> Alpha is a bruiser for games where the enemy cannot end every fight in one clean burst. He is pickable when your team can start first or force clustered skirmishes, but he becomes a liability when anti-heal, long-range control, and mobile carries deny the repeated Beta hits that make him matter.

